    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "duration": 18.0,
      "text": "With explicit authorization, guarded deletion executed: eighteen quarantined debris files, eighteen regenerable test databases, and two primary pytest caches were removed. Eight protected caches and the secret-adjacent environment file stayed retained. No tracked file changed; the regeneration check passed four tests.",
