    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "duration": 16.0,
      "text": "Kun's docs-only implementation also built status and debate map version one from the frozen sixteen-entry claim ledger. Four axes preserve twenty-eight counterevidence items and four epistemic caps. The validator resolved every entry and returned PASS, with no database, Git, runtime, or publication action.",
